<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cognex raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cognex raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for Cognex Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Natick, Mass., software and special computer maker opened up 1-1/16 to 19-5/16.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
